            <p>The route passes through key cities and towns such as Washington, D.C., Richmond, Raleigh, Charleston, Savannah, Jacksonville, before reaching downtown Orlando. Along the way, travelers can enjoy natural scenery and glimpses of historic Southern towns.</p>
